---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Prompt from "../components/Prompt.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Writing - Imam Hossain Roni" sideBarActiveItemID="blog">
  <Prompt dir="~/writing" cmd="cat why-i-stopped-writing-tech-blogs.md">
    <h1 class="md-h1 !mt-1">Why I stopped writing tech blogs</h1>
    <p>In the era of LLMs, I don't think writing tech blogs is as necessary as it once was.</p>
    <p>
      There was a time when I'd spend my evenings turning something I had just figured out into a post, hoping it would
      save someone else a few hours of frustration. Today, anyone can ask an LLM and get a clear, patient explanation in
      seconds, shaped around exactly where they are stuck.
    </p>
    <p>
      So I stopped writing tutorials. When I write now, I write what I feel: the thoughts that don't fit into a prompt.
    </p>
    <p>If you're here to learn something technical, LLMs are good enough. Honestly, they're a wonderful teacher.</p>
    <p>My earlier writing, and some of my more abstract thoughts, are kept as an archive.</p>
  </Prompt>

  <Prompt dir="~/writing" cmd="open archive">
    <p>
      <span class="c-magenta font-bold">RIP Abstract Thoughts 🤔</span> →
      <a href="https://imamhossainroni.hashnode.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">imamhossainroni.hashnode.dev</a>
    </p>
  </Prompt>
</BaseLayout>
